---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";

---

<MainLayout
  title="Legal | NYCUNO"
  description="Review NYCUNO's legal information, privacy commitments, intellectual property, and dispute resolution policies."
  currentPage="Legal"
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-site flex-1 px-4 py-12.5 sm:px-6">
    <section>
      <h1
        class="relative mb-7 pb-5 font-sans text-[35px] font-medium leading-none text-brand after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-[50px] after:bg-brand"
        data-reveal="up"
      >
        Legal
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-base font-normal leading-[26px] text-[#404040]">
        <p data-reveal="up">
          nycuno is dedicated to upholding the highest legal standards to
          ensure a secure and reliable platform for our users. By accessing and
          using the nycuno application, you are entering into a legally binding
          agreement with nycuno. It is imperative that users carefully review
          and understand the terms and conditions outlined in our user
          agreement. The terms cover various aspects of your engagement with
          the platform, including user conduct, privacy, and intellectual
          property rights.
        </p>

        <p data-reveal="up">
          We prioritize user privacy and data protection, and our legal
          framework includes robust provisions to safeguard user information.
          nycuno complies with applicable data protection laws and regulations,
          and our privacy policy outlines how user data is collected, used,
          and protected. By utilizing the nycuno application, users agree to
          abide by these privacy policies, and any breaches are subject to
          legal consequences.
        </p>

        <p data-reveal="up">
          NYCUNO reserves the right to take appropriate legal action in the
          event of any unauthorized use or violation of our intellectual
          property rights. All content, trademarks, logos, and other
          intellectual property featured on the nycuno application are the
          exclusive property of nycuno or its affiliates. Any unauthorized
          reproduction or use of these elements is strictly prohibited.
        </p>

        <p data-reveal="up">
          Our commitment to user safety and satisfaction extends beyond legal
          agreements. nycuno employs advanced security measures within the
          application, including real-time monitoring and secure payment
          options. These features are designed to enhance user safety and
          maintain a trustworthy environment for all interactions on our
          platform.
        </p>

        <p data-reveal="up">
          In the rare instance of disputes, nycuno encourages users to engage
          in open communication and amicable resolution. However, should
          disagreements persist, users consent to arbitration as the primary
          method of dispute resolution, in accordance with the rules and
          regulations applicable in the jurisdiction of nycuno's legal
          headquarters.
        </p>

        <p data-reveal="up">
          NYCUNO may, at its discretion, update or modify these legal terms and
          conditions. Users are responsible for regularly reviewing the terms
          to stay informed about any changes. Continued use of the nycuno
          application after such modifications constitutes acceptance of the
          revised terms. We appreciate your cooperation and commitment to
          maintaining a secure and reliable platform for everyone in the nycuno
          community.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
